# Base: exists from game start (never placeable, never damaged). Respawn anchor, always-on team-0
# bubble (self-powered — tickPower never touches non-Emitter types, so the authored Output stands),
# and passive income equal to one extractor of EACH type. Conducts grid links like any structure.
