Prefab gameBase
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer wireshapes
		Node Cube
		Type StaticMesh
		Scale 2 1.5 2
	Component Physics
		Body Static
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 2 1.5 2
	Component Force
		Team 0
		Output 1.3
		Reach 16
		Centered true
